  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "326bdd47677d2279",
      "translationZh": "利益披露：我在 H2O.ai 工作。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5000002726fcd996",
      "translationZh": "我们发布了 H2O-Lightning-4B，这是一个权重开放（Apache-2.0）的模型，用于 Jev 推广普及的“decisions API”式推理：你发送一个状态和带类型的问题（单选 / 是非 / 评分），通过一次前向传播即可得到校准后的概率。不生成任何 token，因此速度快、成本低。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e75582565b191399",
      "translationZh": "结果（JevBench，公开排行榜）：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "1cd5af095545b263",
      "translationZh": "综合得分为 72.5，相比之下 Jev 1.13 为 71.5；目前是排名最高的开放模型",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "8cd947a4a3af0424",
      "translationZh": "排行榜：https://benchmarkheaven.com/jev-models",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ad22293b13554ecd",
      "translationZh": "基础模型：Qwen3.5-4B，经过微调",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "8719c27b0a7f8a3d",
      "translationZh": "原版 vLLM 加上一个小型开放适配层（位于代码仓库中）；在一张 H100 上，每次决策约需 30 ms",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "4b7d5bf13738c140",
      "translationZh": "你的数据留在本地，无按调用收费",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "048df6111ba3c109",
      "translationZh": "即将推出：12B 和 31B 版本，在我们的内部测试中，它们明显比以下模型更智能：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d424dd2eb8072c2b",
      "translationZh": "Jev，仍然开放权重，而且每次决策仍然只需一次前向传播。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "93e102dd63c297a6",
      "translationZh": "演示（对收件箱中的 1,000 份保险理赔申请进行分流、多浏览器网页智能体、按决策时钟运行的 DOOM）：https://youtu.be/2Qp04Wu0A14",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7f4b827ad2942efd",
      "translationZh": "权重、模型卡和推理服务部署说明：https://huggingface.co/h2oai/h2o-lightning-4b",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6a11a04610289994",
      "translationZh": "很乐意回答有关配置和延迟的问题。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
